      "target": "../sections/slide-003.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Testing\nTest Data and Test Harnesss\n10\nComponents of L2 DAK (Digital Adaptation Kit)\n\n## Speaker notes\n\nSo there are 8 components to a digital adaptation kit in total. With each component of the DAK contributing to key design features of a digital tool meant to be used at the individual level by a health worker. Through these 8 components, this DAK focuses on providing the content requirements for digital system also known as a person-centred point of service systems used in primary health care settings by health workers for provision of vaccination services.\n\n## Images\n\n- `image14.png` — alt:",
